{"skill":{"slug":"openai-tts","displayName":"OpenAI TTS"},"version":{"version":"1.0.0","createdAt":1767688174911,"changelog":"Initial release - text-to-speech via OpenAI API with 6 voice options","changelogSource":"user","license":null,"files":[{"path":"SKILL.md","size":1655,"sha256":"b9bc7aa496bfccb5ea3afa96fa4c7f1d7a7d23bfc3b7ddd04dc3be02c5db3b07","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"scripts/speak.sh","size":1656,"sha256":"0c6c96b7f074a6c45badd0f65ebe0ab902ea7aad5da6b4ed35e53e3f4ecdf4ac","contentType":"application/x-sh"},{"path":"skill-card.md","size":1698,"sha256":"85bfecfae9d0b5ec8ff84b2e4d1385f10368b9c9fbb69175c51c21dfd88d2974","contentType":"text/markdown"}],"security":{"status":"clean","hasWarnings":true,"checkedAt":1789015011105,"model":null,"hasScanResult":true,"sha256hash":"6b947e48bcb3aeac0c752eaac2e32f05db335e7e9aa7e044836cee204196beeb","virustotalUrl":"https://www.virustotal.com/gui/file/6b947e48bcb3aeac0c752eaac2e32f05db335e7e9aa7e044836cee204196beeb","scanners":{"vt":{"status":"clean","verdict":"benign","normalizedStatus":"clean","analysis":"Type: OpenClaw Skill\nName: openai-tts\nVersion: 1.0.0\n\nThe skill bundle is benign. The `SKILL.md` provides clear, descriptive instructions without any prompt injection attempts. The `scripts/speak.sh` script correctly interacts with the legitimate OpenAI TTS API endpoint (`https://api.openai.com/v1/audio/speech`), uses the `OPENAI_API_KEY` as expected, and safely escapes user input for the JSON payload using `jq -Rs .`. There is no evidence of data exfiltration to unauthorized endpoints, malicious execution, persistence mechanisms, or obfuscation.","source":"palm","checkedAt":1779159649118},"skillspector":{"status":"suspicious","normalizedStatus":"suspicious","score":35,"severity":"MEDIUM","recommendation":"CAUTION","issueCount":5,"checkedAt":1789015011105},"llm":{"status":"clean","verdict":"benign","normalizedStatus":"clean","confidence":"high","summary":"This is a straightforward OpenAI text-to-speech skill that sends user-selected text to OpenAI and optionally saves the returned audio locally.","dimensions":[{"detail":"Network access to api.openai.com and use of OPENAI_API_KEY are proportionate for a cloud TTS wrapper; there is no evidence of unrelated host inspection, remote code execution, or broad local data access.","label":"Credentials","name":"environment_proportionality","rating":"ok"},{"detail":"The metadata declares curl and OPENAI_API_KEY, while the script also depends on jq for JSON escaping; this is an operational dependency gap, not a security escalation.","label":"Install Mechanism","name":"install_mechanism","rating":"note"},{"detail":"The documentation names the OpenAI API and endpoint, but it does not prominently warn users that all input text is transmitted off-device; this is purpose-aligned but worth clearer disclosure.","label":"Instruction Scope","name":"instruction_scope","rating":"note"},{"detail":"The only persistence is a user-directed --out path for the generated audio file and the documented optional API-key configuration; there are no services, hooks, scheduled tasks, or privilege escalation mechanisms.","label":"Persistence & Privilege","name":"persistence_privilege","rating":"ok"},{"detail":"The declared purpose is text-to-speech via OpenAI's Audio Speech API, and the script implements that by sending the provided text, model, voice, format, and speed to the documented OpenAI endpoint.","label":"Purpose & Capability","name":"purpose_capability","rating":"ok"}],"guidance":"Install this only if you are comfortable sending the text you provide to OpenAI for speech generation. Avoid using it for secrets or confidential content unless that is allowed in your environment, and note that using --out writes the generated audio to the path you choose.","findings":"[SQP-2] expected: The privacy concern is valid as guidance because user text leaves the machine, but the artifact's name and documentation explicitly identify OpenAI's Audio Speech API, so this does not indicate hidden or purpose-mismatched behavior.\n[E1] expected: The curl calls to https://api.openai.com/v1/audio/speech transmit the supplied text to OpenAI, which is the core function of this TTS skill rather than unexpected exfiltration.","agenticRiskFindings":null,"riskSummary":null,"model":null,"checkedAt":1789015011105}}}}}